# Evolution: a level-up in a battle evolves the Pokémon after it (decomp
# BATTLE_STATE_CHECK_EVOLUTION). Piplup L15, one exp point short of L16 (medium slow: 2535), knows three
# moves; it wins a wild battle on Route 202, grows to L16 and evolves into Prinplup, which learns Metal Claw
# at 16 (decomp Pokemon_LevelUpMove after evolving). The waits play the scene (`evolve auto`).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_PIPLUP 15 platinum:MOVE_POUND platinum:MOVE_BUBBLE platinum:MOVE_PECK
set state party[0].exp 2534
set var platinum:VAR_ROUTE_202_STATE 1
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_202 178 827 up
until idle
+0 evolve auto
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
+0 press up
+30 release up
+0 press down
+30 release down
until battle 900
battle auto 3000
+0 assert battle wild * won
+0 assert app evolution
until app none 3000
+0 assert state party[0].species "platinum:SPECIES_PRINPLUP"
+0 assert state party[0].level 16
+0 assert state party[0].moves ["platinum:MOVE_POUND","platinum:MOVE_BUBBLE","platinum:MOVE_PECK","platinum:MOVE_METAL_CLAW"]
+0 assert state party[0].nickname null
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
